Error [E1004]: `SigningKey` has no `generate`
  --> tests/ui/retired_signing_key_generate.jet:5:30
    |
  5 |     key :: crypto.SigningKey.generate()
    |                              ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Constructors that draw entropy use `new_random`
 Fix: Use `SigningKey.new_random()`
